    "title": "Angular Analysis of $B \\to D^{*}\\ell \\barν_{\\ell}$ from Lattice and Experiment: $|V_{cb}|$ and New Physics Constraints",
    "authors": "Marzia Bordone, Ollie Heald, Andreas Jüttner",
    "published": "2026-06-22",
